<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>WARDEN mpx 1.5x scope</Major>
    <Description>The settings i use are :

1920x1080  4:3 apect ratio

Sens: Y22 X16 800 DPI 60hz

Here are the steps:

1. lauch R6 
2. Put the macro on left mouse button 
3. Put it on Hold to run- V important
4. start a match
5. ENJOY




</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download</Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>MoveR -1 3
Delay 10 ms
MoveR -1 7
Delay 10 ms
MoveR 1 5
Delay 10 ms
MoveR 0 7
Delay 10 ms</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Tom Clancy's Rainbow Six Siege</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>